{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611012014398839294838268d9d6y8tQw7iC","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_ad42772b0f4e4382a2e0f5179d3e791b","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const workspace = figma.getNodeById('8:2');\nif (!workspace) return \"Workspace node not found\";\nreturn {\n  id: workspace.id,\n  name: workspace.name,\n  children: workspace.children.map(c => ({ id: c.id, name: c.name, type: c.type }))\n};\n","description":"Inspect 03 · Workspace page","fileKey":"ysVFKAVp9vIXGyYMO8MY33"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21770,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":18964},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06fbff5f-a7f3-4edc-8cf6-ab7b50201e39","uuid":"8cb5c622-fb7b-4de3-9d88-a5b2480c719e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:14:44.019Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_ad42772b0f4e4382a2e0f5179d3e791b","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
